<li>David D. Buck (1990–1994, University of Wisconsin–Milwaukee)</li>
<li>Anand A. Yang (1995–2000, University of Utah)</li>
<li>Ann Waltner (2001–2004, University of Minnesota)</li>
<li>Kenneth M. George (2005–2008, University of Wisconsin–Madison)</li>
<li>Jeffrey Wasserstrom (2008–2018, University of California-Irvine)</li>
